2026-10-25T10:11:18.5824190Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5850590Z [0m
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5851220Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5851870Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5852290Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5852680Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5853330Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5853790Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5854110Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5854670Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5855000Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5855470Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5856100Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5867110Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5867450Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5867620Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5867950Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5868150Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5868370Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5868760Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5868860Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5868990Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5869150Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5869510Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5869910Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5881420Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5883310Z I will:
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5885060Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5885460Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5886490Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5887600Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5888500Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5889240Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5889860Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5890820Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5891860Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5907960Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5908970Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5944530Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5945050Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5946110Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5946690Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T10:11:18.5947320Z 
